ld.' => '此為必填欄位。','This is not a valid email address.' => '這不是一個有效的電子郵件地址。','This field does not match the related field value.' => '此欄位與相關欄位值不符。','The CPF number "{cpf_number}" is invalid.' => 'CPF 編號「{cpf_number}」無效。','The CNPJ number "{cnpj_number}" is invalid.' => 'CNPJ 編號「{cnpj_number}」無效。','(Required)' => '（必需的）','Checkout Header - Desktop' => '結帳標題 - 桌面','Display widgets on the checkout header for large screens. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout header.' => '在大螢幕的結帳標題上顯示小工具。僅在使用插件的結帳標頭時顯示。','Checkout Header - Mobile' => '結帳標題 - 行動版','Display widgets below the checkout header for mobile devices. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout header.' => '在行動裝置的結帳標題下方顯示小工具。僅在使用插件的結帳標頭時顯示。','Checkout Sidebar' => '結帳側邊欄','Display widgets on the checkout sidebar after the order summary.' => '訂單摘要後在結帳側欄上顯示小工具。','Checkout Order Summary' => '結帳訂單摘要','Display widgets inside the order summary at the checkout page.' => '在結帳頁面的訂單摘要中顯示小工具。','Checkout Below Place Order' => '在下面結帳下訂單','Display widgets below the place order button at the checkout page.' => '在結帳頁面的下訂單按鈕下方顯示小工具。','Checkout Footer' => '結帳頁腳','Display widgets on the checkout footer. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout footer.' => '在結帳頁腳上顯示小工具。僅在使用外掛程式的結帳頁腳時顯示。','Classic' => '經典的','Boxed' => '盒裝','Split' => '分裂','Minimalist' => '極簡主義者','Fluid Checkout and Delivery Date plugins by CodeRockz' => 'CodeRockz 的 Fluid Checkout 和 Delivery Date 插件','<p>We detected that you are using the plugins Delivery & Pickup Date Time for WooCommerce (free and PRO) by CodeRockz. Integration with these plugins have been moved to Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>' => '<p>我們偵測到您正在使用 CodeRockz 的 WooCommerce 外掛程式 Delivery &amp; Pickup Date Time（免費版和專業版）。這些插件的整合已移至 Fluid Checkout PRO。</p>','Upgrade to PRO' => '升級至 PRO','Fluid Checkout database updated successfully' => 'Fluid Checkout 資料庫更新成功','The database changes where applied successfully.' => '資料庫變更已成功應用。','Dismiss' => '解僱','Fluid Checkout database update' => 'Fluid Checkout 資料庫更新','Some changes to the database are required. As with any update, we recommend you to <strong>take a full backup of your website before proceeding</strong>.' => '需要對資料庫進行一些更改。與任何更新一樣，我們建議您<strong>在繼續之前對您的網站進行完整備份</strong>。','Update database' => '更新資料庫','Fluid Checkout is not compatible with the Divi Builder checkout layout' => 'Fluid Checkout 與 Divi Builder 結帳佈局不相容','<p>Fluid Checkout needs the classic WooCommerce shortcode-based checkout form to work. When using the Divi Builder to customize the look and feel of the checkout page, the classic shortcodes are replaced with custom widgets from the Divi Builder for each part of the checkout page. These custom widgets are not compatible with Fluid Checkout.</p><p>Please edit your checkout page replacing the Divi Builder widgets with the a text widget containing the shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code>.</p>' => '<p>Fluid Checkout 需要經典的基於 WooCommerce 短代碼的結帳表單才能運作。當使用 Divi Builder 自訂結帳頁面的外觀時，經典的短代碼將被來自 Divi Builder 的針對結帳頁面每個部分的自訂小工具所取代。這些自訂小部件與 Fluid Checkout 不相容。</p><p>請編輯您的結帳頁面，用包含短代碼<code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code>的文字小工具取代 Divi Builder 小工具。</p>','Edit the checkout page' => '編輯結帳頁面','Read the documentation.' => '閱讀文檔。','Germanized PRO multistep checkout feature needs to be disabled when using Fluid Checkout' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 時需要停用 Germanized PRO 多步驟結帳功能','When using Fluid Checkout, the multistep feature from the Germanized PRO plugin becomes unnecessary and can cause <strong>critical errors while processing new orders</strong>. Please disable the Germanized PRO multistep checkout feature in the plugin settings.' => '當使用 Fluid Checkout 時，Germanized PRO 插件的多步驟功能變得沒有必要，並且可能<strong>在處理新訂單時導致嚴重錯誤</strong>。請在插件設定中停用 Germanized PRO 多步驟結帳功能。','Go to Germanized settings' => '轉到德語設定','Thanks for choosing Fluid Checkout!' => '感謝您選擇 Fluid Checkout！','You have been using the plugin for a while now. How do you like it so far? <br>Please give us a quick rating, we appreciate every bit of feedback and it encourages us to keep improving the plugin :)' => '您已經使用該插件一段時間了。到目前為止你覺得它怎麼樣？<br>請給我們一個快速評分，我們感謝每一點回饋，這鼓勵我們不斷改進插件:)','Rate the plugin' => '對插件進行評分','I need help!' => '我需要幫助！','Some features of WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers might not work as expected when using it with Fluid Checkout. Read <a href="%s">our documentation</a> for more information and alternative solutions.' => '當與 Fluid Checkout 一起使用時，Quadlayers 的 WooCommerce Checkout Manager 的某些功能可能無法如預期運作。閱讀<a href="%s">我們的文件</a>以獲取更多資訊和替代解決方案。','Read documentation' => '閱讀文件','Don\'t show this again' => '不再顯示此內容','Fluid Checkout PRO' => '流體檢測 PRO','More design templates' => '更多設計模板','Optimized cart page' => '優化購物車頁面','Optimized order received / thank you page' => '優化訂單已收到/感謝頁面','Edit cart contents at checkout page' => '在結帳頁面編輯購物車內容','Account matching / user matching' => '帳戶匹配/用戶匹配','Trust symbols on the cart and thank you pages' => '購物車和感謝頁面上的信任符號','More positions for the coupon code on the checkout page' => '結帳頁面上的優惠券代碼的更多位置','International phone numbers' => '國際電話號碼','Gift messages and packing slips' => '禮品訊息和裝箱單','Local pickup and in-store collection' => '本地取貨和店內取貨','EU-VAT Assistant' => '歐盟增值稅助手','I already have it – Hide this offer' => '我已經擁有 – 隱藏此優惠','Activated' => '活性','Address book' => '地址簿','Select an image' => '選擇影像','Cart layout' => '購物車佈局','Cart optimizations' => '購物車優化','Enable cart page optimizations' => '啟用購物車頁面優化','Header and footer template' => '頁首和頁尾模板','Controls whether to use the distraction free page header and footer or keep the currently active theme\'s header and footer.' => '控制是否使用無幹擾頁首和頁尾或保留目前活動主題的頁首和頁尾。','Distraction free header and footer' => '無幹擾的頁首和頁尾','Theme\'s header and footer' => '主題的頁首和頁尾','Cart elements' => '購物車元素','Make the order summary stay visible on the cart page while scrolling' => '使訂單摘要在滾動時保持在購物車頁面上可見','Coupon codes' => '優惠券代碼','Hidden' => '隱','Before the cart items section' => '購物車商品部分前','Inside the cart items section' => '在購物車商品部分內','After the cart items section' => '購物車商品部分之後','Before the shipping section' => '運輸部分之前','After the shipping section' => '運輸部分之後','Before the order summary' => '訂單摘要之前','Inside the order summary' => '訂單摘要內','Before the order totals' => '訂單總計之前','After the order totals' => '訂單總計後','After the order summary' => '訂單匯總後','Shipping' => '船運','Select position where to display the shipping costs and calculator on the cart page.' => '選擇在購物車頁面上顯示運費和計算器的位置。','Display as a cart section' => '顯示為購物車部分','Cross-sells' => '交叉銷售','Select position where to display the cross-sells section on the cart page.' => '選擇在購物車頁面上顯示交叉銷售部分的位置。','Before the cart actions' => '在購物車操作之前','After the cart actions' => '購物車操作後','Layout of cross-sell items on the cart page.' => '購物車頁面上交叉銷售商品的佈局。','Optimized horizontal cross-sells layout' => '優化橫向交叉銷售佈局','Theme\'s cross-sells layout' => '主題的交叉銷售佈局','Number of cross-sell items to display on the cart page' => '購物車頁面上顯示的交叉銷售商品數量','Add widget areas to the cart page' => '將小工具區域加入購物車頁面','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the cart page.' => '這些小部件區域用於在購物車頁面上添加信任符號和信任徽章。','Checkout' => '查看','Checkout layout' => '結帳佈局','Design template' => '設計模板','Dark mode' => '暗黑模式','Enable dark mode' => '啟用暗模式','Logo image' => '標誌圖像','Choose an image to be displayed on the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => '選擇要在結帳頁面標題上顯示的圖像。僅適用於使用無幹擾的頁首和頁尾時。','Header background color' => '標題背景顏色','Choose a background color for the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => '選擇結帳頁面標題的背景顏色。僅適用於使用無幹擾的頁首和頁尾時。','HTML color value. ie: #f3f3f3' => 'HTML 顏色值。例如：#f3f3f3','Page background color' => '頁面背景顏色','Choose a background color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => '選擇結帳頁面的背景顏色。顏色應用於<em>身體</em>元素。','Footer background color' => '頁腳背景顏色','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => '選擇結帳頁腳的背景顏色。僅適用於使用無幹擾的頁首和頁尾時。','Progress bar' => '進度條','Display the checkout progress bar when using multi-step checkout layout' => '使用多步驟結帳佈局時顯示結帳進度條','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => '使結帳進度條在滾動時保持可見','Express checkout' => '快速結帳','Enable the express checkout section' => '啟用快速結帳部分','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => '當支援的支付網關啟用此功能時，在結帳時顯示快速結帳部分。','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => '在大螢幕上一行顯示快速結帳按鈕','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => '使用相容的快速結帳支付網關付款時，忽略額外的結帳必填字段','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => '使訂單摘要在滾動時保持可見','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => '選擇訂單摘要部分的背景顏色。','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => '反白顯示訂單摘要表中的訂單總計行','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => '當訂單摘要部分沒有突出顯示的背景顏色時最有用。使用 Fluid Checkout PRO 時，也可能適用於購物車、訂單已收到和查看訂單頁面。','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => '結帳時訂單摘要上的操作連結。','Edit cart link' => '編輯購物車鏈接','Cart items count' => '購物車商品數量','Link to shop page' => '連結至商店頁面','Cart items' => '購物車商品','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => '在結帳頁面隱藏購物車商品錯誤','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => '不要在結帳頁面頂部顯示購物車商品錯誤訊息。提交結帳表單以完成購買時，將始終顯示這些錯誤訊息。','Place order' => '下訂單','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => '定義顯示「下訂單」和條款複選框部分的位置。','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => '某些選項可能與某些外掛程式和主題不相容。','Below the payment section' => '付款部分下方','Below the order summary' => '訂單摘要下方','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => '付款部分和訂單摘要下方','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => '將小工具區域新增至結帳頁面','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => '這些小工具區域用於在結帳頁面上新增信任符號和信任徽章。','Display the coupon codes section title' => '顯示優惠券代碼部分標題','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => '選擇在結帳頁面上顯示優惠券代碼部分的位置。','Before the checkout steps' => '結帳步驟之前','As a substep before payment methods' => '作為付款方式之前的子步驟','As a substep after payment methods' => '作為付款方式之後的子步驟','Default button style' => '預設按鈕樣式','"Add" link button' => '“新增”連結按鈕','Checkout fields' => '結帳字段','Optional fields' => '選用字段','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => '隱藏連結按鈕後面的可選字段','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => '建議保持選取此選項以減少開啟的輸入欄位的數量， <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">請閱讀研究</a>。','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => '不要將「地址行 2」欄位隱藏在連結按鈕後面','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => '只有當大多數客戶確實需要“地址行 2”字段，或者獲取正確的送貨地址至關重要時（即運送食品和其他易腐爛產品時）才推薦。','Billing address' => '帳單地址','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => '選擇在結帳頁面上顯示帳單地址部分的位置。','As a step before shipping' => '作為出貨前的步驟','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => '作為送貨地址部分之前的子步驟','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => '作為送貨地址部分之後的子步驟','As a step after shipping' => '作為出貨後的步驟','As a sub-step before the payment section' => '作為付款部分之前的子步驟','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => '強制帳單地址和送貨地址相同（單一部分）','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => '預設選取「與送貨/帳單地址相同」複選框','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => '當首先顯示送貨地址部分時，複選框「與送貨地址相同」將預設為選取狀態。<br>當首先顯示帳單地址部分時，核取方塊「與帳單地址相同」將預設為選取狀態。<br>建議選取此選項，以顯著減少結帳時開啟的輸入欄位的數量， <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">請閱讀研究</a>。','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => '在結帳表單中反白顯示帳單地址部分','Shipping address' => '收件地址','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => '在結帳表單中反白顯示送貨地址部分','Shipping methods' => '送貨方式','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => '選擇在哪個位置顯示運送方式部分。','Before shipping address' => '出貨前地址','After shipping address' => '發貨地址後','Local pickup' => '本地取貨','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => '當選擇本地取貨運送方式時，刪除送貨地址部分。','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => '當選擇本地取貨運送方式時，將送貨地址替換為取貨點位置。','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => '選擇將哪個地址儲存為本地取貨訂單的送貨地址。','Save the selected pickup location' => '保存所選取貨地點','Save same as the billing address' => '儲存與帳單地址相同','Do not save any shipping address' => '不保存任何送貨地址','Company name field for shipping address' => '送貨地址的公司名稱字段','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => '更改結帳表單上送貨地址部分的公司名稱欄位的可見性。','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => '如果欄位設為“可選”，即預設可見性狀態，則不會套用任何變更以讓其他外掛程式套用其所需的任何變更。','Hidden (remove field)' => '隱藏（刪除字段）','Optional' => '選修的','Required' => '必需的','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => '在結帳表單中新增送貨電話欄位。','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => '選擇在哪一步驟顯示送貨電話欄位。','Contact step' => '聯繫步驟','Billing phone' => '帳單電話','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => '在結帳表單中新增帳單電話欄位。','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => '選擇在哪一步顯示計費電話欄位。','Show country code beside the flag' => '在旗幟旁顯示國家代碼','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => '顯示電話欄位內有效電話號碼的範例','Do not change placeholders' => '不要更改佔位符','Show if not defined' => '若未定義則顯示','Always show' => '始終顯示','Order notes' => '訂單備註','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => '定義附加訂單備註欄位的可見性。','Gift options' => '禮品選項','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => '允許顧客在訂單中添加禮品資訊和其他與禮品相關的選項。','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => '將禮品資訊顯示為訂單詳細資料表的一部分，而不是單獨的部分','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => '此選項會影響訂單確認頁面（感謝頁面）和帳戶頁面、電子郵件和包裝清單上的訂單詳細資訊。','Account matching' => '帳戶匹配','Enable the account matching feature' => '啟用帳戶匹配功能','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => '當已存在包含客戶聯絡資訊的帳戶時，將來賓客戶的訂單與其現有帳戶關聯起來。','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => '當存在具有所提供電子郵件地址的帳戶時顯示訊息','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => '用通知和登入選項取代帳戶建立欄位。','Dashboard' => '儀表板','Integrations' => '整合','License keys' => '許可證密鑰','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => '請訪問我們的網站以獲取有關我們的插件和附加元件的更多資訊。','Order pay page' => '訂單支付頁面','Order pay' => '訂單支付','Enable order pay page optimizations' => '啟用訂單支付頁面優化','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => '更改等待客戶付款的現有訂單的訂單支付頁面佈局。','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => '在訂單支付頁面新增小工具區域','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => '這些小工具區域用於在訂單支付頁面中新增信任符號和信任徽章。','Thank you page & order details layout' => '感謝頁面和訂單詳情佈局','Order details optimizations' => '訂單詳情優化','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => '啟用感謝頁面和訂單詳情優化','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => '更改感謝頁面和帳戶頁面上的訂單詳細資訊的佈局。','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => '在電子郵件通知中啟用訂單詳細資訊自訂','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => '顯示新部分並更改電子郵件通知中的部分順序。郵件通知中的訂單詳情樣式保持不變。','Thank you page' => '感謝頁面','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => '這些選項會影響感謝頁面，也稱為訂單已收到頁面或訂單確認頁面。','Order details layout' => '訂單詳情佈局','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => '在感謝頁面上以寬版顯示訂單詳情','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => '將小部件區域新增至感謝頁面','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => '這些小部件區域用於在感謝頁面上添加信任符號和信任徽章。','Order actions' => '訂單操作','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => '選擇在哪個位置顯示訂單操作。','Inside the order overview' => '訂單概覽內','After the order overview' => '訂單概覽後','After order sections' => '訂購部分後','Order status' => '訂單狀態','Display the order status progress bar' => '顯示訂單狀態進度條','Choose in which position to display the section.' => '選擇在哪個位置顯示該部分。','After the order overview and payment instructions' => '訂單概覽和付款說明後','Before the order items section' => '訂單商品部分前','Inside the order items section' => '在訂單商品部分內','After the order items section' => '訂單商品部分之後','On the sidebar' => '在側邊欄上','Order downloads' => '訂購下載','Gift message' => '禮物留言','Tools' => '工具','Troubleshooting' => '故障排除','Debug options' => '偵錯選項','Debug mode' => '偵錯模式','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => '使用調試模式會影響網站效能。僅在排除故障時使用此選項。','Load unminified assets' => '載入未縮小的資源','Enhanced select fields' => '增強選擇字段','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => '修復表單欄位自動放大問題','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => '將表單欄位內的<code>font-size</code>設定為 16px','Fluid Checkout' => '流體檢查','Settings' => '設定','Support' => '支援','<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade to PRO</a> to unlock more options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%s">升級至 PRO</a>可解鎖更多選項。','(PRO)' => '（專業版）','(experimental)' => '（實驗）','Please verify your phone number.' => '請驗證您的電話號碼。','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'Bluehost 插件','Custom fields' => '自訂字段','Enable custom shipping email field' => '啟用自訂運輸電子郵件字段','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => '啟用後，Bluehost 外掛程式的出貨電子郵件欄位將會加入結帳表單中。','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'BestWebSoft 的 Captcha Pro','Captcha position' => '驗證碼位置','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => '定義顯示驗證碼部分的位置。根據所選的驗證碼類型，某些位置可能無法運作。','Selecting a pickup point is required before proceeding.' => '繼續操作之前，需要選擇一個接送點。','Pickup point' => '取貨點','Pickup point not selected yet.' => '尚未選擇取貨點。','Pickup point:' => '取貨點：','Mailchimp for WooCommerce' => 'WooCommerce 的 Mailchimp','Subscribe checkbox' => '訂閱複選框','Override the position for the subscribe checkbox on the checkout page and always display it on the contact step' => '覆蓋結帳頁面上訂閱複選框的位置，並始終在聯絡步驟中顯示它','Before Shipping Address' => '出貨前地址','(originally "%s")' => '（原本是“%s”）','After Shipping Address' => '送貨地址後','Selecting a collection point is required when shipping with FermoPoint.' => '使用 FermoPoint 運送時需要選擇一個收集點。','If checked informs typos in email to users. (This feature has been disabled because Fluid Checkout offers the feature. Changes to this option will not take effect)' => '如果選中，則會向使用者發送電子郵件告知拼字錯誤。 （由於 Fluid Checkout 提供了該功能，因此該功能已停用。對該選項的變更不會生效）','Enable Mail Check: (disabled feature)' => '啟用郵件檢查：（停用功能）','Carrier:' => '載體：','Sendinblue - WooCommerce Email Marketing' => 'Sendinblue-WooCommerce 電子郵件行銷','Sign up checkbox position' => '註冊複選框位置','Move the sign up checkbox to the contact step' => '將註冊複選框移至聯絡步驟','When enabled, the checkbox will be moved to the contact step independently of the display location defined in the Sendinblue plugin settings.' => '啟用後，複選框將移至聯繫步驟，與 Sendinblue 外掛程式設定中定義的顯示位置無關。','Theme Betheme' => '主題 Betheme','Checkout progress' => '結帳進度','Output the checkout steps section from Betheme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在結帳、購物車和訂單收到頁面上從 Betheme 輸出結帳步驟部分。','Theme Fennik' => '主題 Fennik','Breadcrumbs' => '麵包屑','Output the breadcrumbs section from the Fennik theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 頁首和頁尾時，從 Fennik 主題輸出麵包屑部分。','Theme Go' => '主題圍棋','My account layout' => '我的帳戶佈局','Enable wide layout on "My account" page.' => '在「我的帳戶」頁面啟用寬版面。','Theme Impreza' => '主題翼豹','Header' => '標頭','Spacing for site header at the checkout page (in pixels)' => '結帳頁面上網站標題的間距（以像素為單位）','Only applicable when using the Impreza theme header at the checkout page.' => '僅適用於結帳頁面使用 Impreza 主題標題時。','Theme Kapee' => '主題 Kapee','Output the checkout steps section from the Kapee theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在結帳、購物車和訂單收到頁面上從 Kapee 主題輸出結帳步驟部分。','Theme Porto' => '主題波爾圖','Output the checkout steps section from the Porto theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在結帳、購物車和訂單收到頁面上輸出波爾圖主題的結帳步驟部分。','Theme Pressmart' => '主題 Pressmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Pressmart theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在結帳、購物車和訂單收到頁面上輸出 Pressmart 主題的結帳步驟部分。','Theme The Gem' => '主題寶石','Output the checkout steps section from The Gem theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 頁首和頁尾時，從 The Gem 主題輸出結帳步驟部分。','Theme Woodmart' => '主題木市場','Output the checkout steps section from the Woodmart theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 頁首和頁尾時，從 Woodmart 主題輸出結帳步驟部分。','Checkout options' => '結帳選項','Disable the theme checkout options' => '停用主題簽出選項','The options display product image, quantity field, remove button and link to product page added by the theme are disabled by default.' => '主題新增的選項顯示產品圖像、數量欄位、刪除按鈕和產品頁面連結預設是停用的。','Theme Atomion' => '主題 Atomion','Order progress' => '訂單進度','Display order progress from the theme' => '從主題顯示訂單進度','Display the form field labels visible on the page' => '顯示頁面上可見的表單欄位標籤','It is recommended to keep this option enabled for a better user experience.' => '建議保持此選項啟用以獲得更好的用戶體驗。','Theme ZK Nito' => '主題 ZK Nito','Add extra fields to the checkout form' => '在結帳表單中新增額外字段','Adds an extra shipping email and shipping phone field to the shipping address section.' => '在送貨地址部分新增額外的送貨電子郵件和送貨電話欄位。','Go to the home page' => '轉至首頁','Skip to content' => '跳至內容','Create an account' => '建立一個帳戶','Log in to your account' => '登入您的帳戶','Already have an account?' => '已有帳戶？','Logged in as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log out</a>' => '已以 %1$s 登入。<a href="%2$s">登出</a>','Your order has a total amount due of %s. No further payment is needed.' => '您的訂單應付總金額為 %s。不需再付款。','Close and continue with checkout' => '關閉並繼續結帳','Continue' => '繼續','Parcel terminal' => '包裹終端','<p>This widget has been replaced by Fluid Checkout. </p><p>When using Fluid Checkout, the checkout page needs to use the original WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> to work properly.</p><p>For more information, visit the Fluid Checkout documentation.</p>' => '<p>該小部件已被 Fluid Checkout 取代。</p><p>使用 Fluid Checkout 時，結帳頁面需要使用原始 WooCommerce 短代碼<code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code>才能正常運作。</p><p>欲了解更多信息，請訪問 Fluid Checkout 文件。</p>','Theme The7' => '主題 The7','Additional header sections' => '附加標題部分','Output additional header sections if enabled in the theme settings.' => '如果在主題設定中啟用，則輸出附加標題部分。','More information' => '更多資訊','Pick a Locker' => '選擇一個儲物櫃','Page template' => '頁面模板','Use `Order confirmation` page template for block-based themes' => '使用基於區塊的主題的“訂單確認”頁面模板','Only applies when using a block-based theme.' => '僅適用於使用基於區塊的主題時。','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway' => 'WooCommerce Stripe 網關','Payment form' => '付款表格','Apply styles to the Stripe payment form fields' => '將樣式套用至 Stripe 付款表單字段','When enabled, Fluid Checkout will apply styles optimized for compatibility with the plugin. You may want to disable this if you are using custom styles for the Stripe payment form fields.' => '啟用後，Fluid Checkout 將套用已最佳化的樣式，以相容於外掛程式。如果您在 Stripe 付款表單欄位中使用自訂樣式，則可能需要停用此功能。','Theme Nyture' => '主題之夜','Output the checkout steps section from the Nyture theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 時從 Nyture 主題輸出結帳步驟部分。','Allows customers to make payments for orders that are either created manually by the store admin or not completed during checkout.' => '允許客戶支付由商店管理員手動建立或在結帳時未完成的訂單。','The plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers is not compatible with Fluid Checkout' => 'Quadlayers 的 WooCommerce Checkout Manager 外掛程式與 Fluid Checkout 不相容','Company name field for billing address' => '帳單地址的公司名稱字段','Change visibility for the company name field for the billing address section on the checkout form.' => '變更結帳表單上帳單地址部分的公司名稱欄位的可見性。','Theme Bookshelf' => '主題書架','Output the checkout steps section from the Bookshelf theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 時，從 Bookshelf 主題輸出結帳步驟部分。','Account password' => '帳號密碼','An account will be created with the information provided at checkout when completing the order.' => '完成訂單後，將使用結帳時提供的資訊建立帳戶。','Choose the style of the progress bar.' => '選擇進度條的樣式。','Bars' => '酒吧','Theme Ireca' => '主題 Ireca','WooCommerce page layout' => 'WooCommerce 頁面佈局','Force wide layout on WooCommerce pages' => '強制 WooCommerce 頁面上的寬佈局','This ensures the content section is not too narrow on WooCommerce pages including checkout, cart, order received, order pay and account pages.' => '這可確保 WooCommerce 頁面上的內容部分不會太窄，包括結帳、購物車、收到訂單、訂單付款和帳戶頁面。','WooCommerce Smart Coupons' => 'WooCommerce智能優惠券','Position on checkout page' => '結帳頁面上的位置','Choose where to display the available coupons section on the checkout page.' => '選擇在結帳頁面上顯示可用優惠券部分的位置。','Before the progress bar' => '進度條之前','After the progress bar' => '進度條之後','Before coupon codes section' => '優惠券代碼部分之前','Format phone numbers according to the rules for each country.' => '請依各國規定格式化電話號碼。','Use precise phone number validation' => '使用精確的電話號碼驗證','This is an experimental feature and may not work as expected in all setups. Use it with caution.' => '這是一項實驗性功能，可能無法在所有環境下正常運作。請謹慎使用。','Phone number validation types used when precise validation is enabled.' => '啟用精確驗證時使用的電話號碼驗證類型。','Mobile' => '移動的','Fixed line' => '固定線路','Toll free' => '免費電話','Contact' => '接觸','Multi step' => '多步驟','2 columns' => '2列','1 column' => '1列','Before checkout steps' => '結帳前的步驟','Or' => '或者','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> checkout layout this option is always set to <em>"Before checkout steps"</em> and also applies to desktop view.' => '使用<em>「1 列」</em>結帳佈局時，此選項始終設定為<em>「結帳步驟之前」</em> ，並且也適用於桌面視圖。','Position for the extra order summary section on mobile.' => '行動端額外訂單摘要部分的位置。','The option <em>"On the site header"</em> only applies when using the distraction-free header.' => '<em>「在網站頁首」</em>選項僅在使用無幹擾頁首時適用。','On the site header (requires distraction-free header)' => '網站頁首（需要無幹擾的頁首）','Initial state for the expansible order summary section on mobile.' => '行動端可擴展訂單摘要部分的初始狀態。','We recommend setting it as <em>expanded</em> for the following countries due to regulatory requirements: <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>Austria</strong>, <strong>Switzerland</strong>, <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong> and <strong>France</strong>.' => '由於監管要求，我們建議將以下國家的設置設為<em>擴展</em>：<strong>德國</strong>、<strong>奧地利</strong>、<strong>瑞士</strong>、<strong>荷蘭</strong>、<strong>波蘭</strong>、<strong>比利時</strong>和<strong>法國</strong>。','Collapsed' => '已折疊','Expanded' => '擴充','Do not show' => '不顯示','yes' => '是的','The shipping phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the billing phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => '如果帳單地址部分顯示在收貨地址部分之後，且帳單電話號碼欄位設定為“必填”，則收貨電話號碼欄位可能會強制設定為“必填”。這是為了確保在選取該選項時，收貨地址可以複製到帳單地址，否則客戶可能無法完成結帳表單。','The billing phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the shipping phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => '如果帳單地址顯示在收貨地址之前，且收貨電話設定為“必填”，則帳單電話欄位可能會強制設定為“必填”。這是為了確保在選取該選項時，收貨地址可以複製到帳單地址，否則客戶可能無法完成結帳表單。','Settings profiles' => '設定設定檔','Settings profile' => '設定設定檔','You do not have permission to perform this action.' => '您沒有執行此操作的權限。','You do not have permission to activate plugins.' => '您沒有啟動插件的權限。','Missing plugin.' => '缺少插件。','Plugin activated.' => '插件已啟用。','The following changes will be applied:' => '將實施以下變更：','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are saved differently. Legacy options are still stored in the database to allow downgrades to previous versions if needed.' => '自 Fluid Checkout 5.0 版本起，設定的儲存方式有所不同。舊版選項仍儲存在資料庫中，以便在需要時降級到先前的版本。','Your store has been running for about 2 weeks on the new settings so you could clean up legacy options stored in the database. Please note that after cleanup, if you need to downgrade to previous versions of the plugin it will use default values for all settings.' => '您的店鋪已在新設定下運行約兩週，因此您可以清理資料庫中儲存的舊版本選項。請注意，清理完成後，如果您需要降級到插件的早期版本，所有設定都將使用預設值。','Fluid Checkout settings cleanup' => 'Fluid Checkout 設定清理','Delete leftover options' => '刪除剩餘選項','Help us improve Fluid Checkout' => '請幫我們改進 Fluid Checkout','Share anonymous site environment reports with Fluid Checkout to get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. No customer, user, or sensitive data are included. You can choose what is shared anytime from the Tools settings.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 分享匿名網站環境報告，即可獲得更快捷的支持，並協助我們提升相容性、評估影響。報告不包含任何客戶、使用者或敏感資料。您可以隨時在「工具」設定中選擇要分享的內容。','Enable site environment reports' => '啟用網站環境報告','Review settings' => '查看設定','This preview has expired. Reload the admin page to start a new preview.' => '此預覽已過期。請重新載入管理頁面以開始新的預覽。','Preview expired' => '預覽已過期','Orders cannot be placed in the preview.' => '預覽模式下無法下單。','Logging in is not available in the preview.' => '預覽版中不支援登入功能。','Accounts cannot be created in the preview.' => '預覽版中無法建立帳戶。','Requests to other sites are blocked in the preview.' => '預覽中已封鎖其他網站的請求。','Processing…' => '加工…','Something went wrong. Please try again.' => '出錯了，請重試。','Activate plugin' => '啟用插件','Fluid Checkout PRO - The complete checkout package' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO - 完整的結帳軟體包','All PRO features + all add-ons, one price. Design templates, optimized cart and order received pages, account matching, and much more.' => '所有專業版功能 + 所有附加元件，只需一個價格。設計模板、優化的購物車和訂單接收頁面、帳戶匹配等等。','Optimized order pay page' => '優化後的訂單支付頁面','Express checkout buttons from supported payment methods' => '支援的付款方式的快捷結帳按鈕','Delayed account creation' => '帳戶創建延遲','Address autocomplete with Google Maps APIs' => '使用谷歌地圖API實現地址自動補全','Multiple saved addresses with the address book' => '地址簿中保存了多個地址','EU-VAT assistant' => '歐盟增值稅助手','Hide this section' => '隱藏此部分','Learn more' => '了解更多','Get early access' => '搶先體驗','Activate add-on' => '啟用插件','Get more out of your checkout journey' => '讓您的結帳過程更加順暢','Test API key' => '測試 API 金鑰','Guided setup' => '引導式設定','Options' => '選項','Set up layout and design on the <a href="%s">checkout options</a>.' => '設定<a href="%s">結帳選項的</a>佈局和設計。','Enable guest checkout and/or review <a href="%s">customer accounts settings</a>.' => '啟用訪客結帳和/或查看<a href="%s">客戶帳戶設定</a>。','Enable optimized <a href="%1$s">cart</a>, <a href="%2$s">thank you</a> and <a href="%3$s">order pay</a> pages.' => '啟用優化的<a href="%1$s">購物車</a>、<a href="%2$s">感謝頁面</a>和<a href="%3$s">訂單支付</a>頁面。','Enable <a href="%s">address autocomplete</a> from Google Maps.' => '啟用Google地圖<a href="%s">位址自動補全功能</a>。','Enable multiple saved addresses with <a href="%s">address book</a>.' => '使用<a href="%s">地址簿</a>保存多個地址。','Check if there are any <a href="%s">integration options</a> available for the theme or other plugins you have installed.' => '檢查你安裝的主題或其他外掛程式是否有任何<a href="%s">整合選項</a>。','Get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. <a href="%s">Enable usage tracking</a> from the tools settings.' => '獲得更快捷的支持，並幫助我們提升相容性、評估影響。請在工具設定中<a href="%s">啟用使用情況追蹤</a>。','Missing settings tab.' => '缺少設定選項卡。','Getting started' => '入門','<strong>Great! Your checkout page is now running on Fluid Checkout.</strong> Here are a few steps to get started:' => '<strong>太棒了！您的結帳頁面現在已基於 Fluid Checkout 運作。</strong>以下是一些入門步驟：','Completed' => '完全的','Preview report data' => '預覽報告數據','Send now' => '立即發送','Auto-detect' => '自動偵測','Afrikaans' => '南非荷蘭語','Albanian' => '阿爾巴尼亞語','Amharic' => '阿姆哈拉語','Arabic' => '阿拉伯','Armenian' => '亞美尼亞','Azerbaijani' => '亞塞拜然','Basque' => '巴斯克','Belarusian' => '白俄羅斯','Bengali' => '孟加拉','Bosnian' => '波士尼亞','Bulgarian' => '保加利亞語','Burmese' => '緬甸','Catalan' => '加泰隆尼亞語','Chinese' => '中國人','Chinese (Simplified)' => '中文（簡體）','Chinese (Hong Kong)' => '中文（香港）','Chinese (Traditional)' => '中文（繁體）','Croatian' => '克羅埃西亞語','Czech' => '捷克語','Danish' => '丹麥語','Dutch' => '荷蘭語','English' => '英語','English (Australian)' => '英語（澳洲）','English (Great Britain)' => '英語（英國）','Estonian' => '愛沙尼亞語','Farsi' => '波斯語','Finnish' => '芬蘭','Filipino' => '菲律賓人','French' => '法語','French (Canadian)' => '法語（加拿大）','Galician' => '加利西亞語','Georgian' => '喬治亞','German' => '德文','Greek' => '希臘文','Gujarati' => '古吉拉特語','Hebrew' => '希伯來文','Hindi' => '印地語','Hungarian' => '匈牙利','Icelandic' => '冰島語','Indonesian' => '印尼','Italian' => '義大利語','Japanese' => '日本人','Kannada' => '卡納達語','Kazakh' => '哈薩克','Khmer' => '高棉語','Korean' => '韓國人','Kyrgyz' => '吉爾吉斯','Lao' => '寮國','Latvian' => '拉脫維亞語','Lithuanian' => '立陶宛語','Macedonian' => '馬其頓','Malay' => '馬來語','Malayalam' => '馬拉雅拉姆語','Marathi' => '馬拉地語','Mongolian' => '蒙','Nepali' => '尼泊爾語','Norwegian' => '挪威','Polish' => '拋光','Portuguese' => '葡萄牙語','Portuguese (Brazil)' => '葡萄牙語（巴西）','Portuguese (Portugal)' => '葡萄牙語（葡萄牙）','Punjabi' => '旁遮普語','Romanian' => '羅馬尼亞語','Russian' => '俄文','Serbian' => '塞爾維亞','Sinhalese' => '僧伽羅語','Slovak' => '斯洛伐克','Slovenian' => '斯洛維尼亞語','Spanish' => '西班牙語','Spanish (Latin America)' => '西班牙語（拉丁美洲）','Swahili' => '斯瓦希里語','Swedish' => '瑞典','Tamil' => '泰米爾語','Telugu' => '泰盧固語','Thai' => '泰國','Turkish' => '土耳其','Ukrainian' => '烏克蘭','Urdu' => '烏爾都語','Vietnamese' => '越南語','Zulu' => '祖魯語','Google address autocomplete' => 'Google 網址自動補全','Google Places API version' => 'Google Places API 版本','Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving to the new Places API as soon as possible.' => '選擇要使用的 Google Places API 版本。我們建議您盡快遷移到新版 Places API。','We recommend using "Places API (New)" as effective March 1, 2025, Google will move the "Places API (Legacy)" version into Legacy status, meaning you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without disruptions.' => '我們建議您使用“Places API（新版）”，因為自 2025 年 3 月 1 日起，Google 將把“Places API（舊版）”版本轉為舊版，這意味著您將無法再為新的 API 金鑰啟用此服務，並且該版本的 API 最終將不再可用。已在使用舊版 API 的現有帳戶可以繼續正常使用，不會受到任何影響。','(Recommended)' => '（受到推崇的）','Google API key' => 'Google API 金鑰','Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from completing their orders.' => '貼上您的 Google API 金鑰，然後使用測試按鈕確認它適用於此網站。請確保金鑰有效且已授權給您的域名，否則地址欄位可能會被屏蔽，導致客戶無法完成訂單。','Enable Google address autocomplete' => '啟用 Google 位址自動填入功能','Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs.' => '使用 Google Maps API 啟用位址自動補全功能。','Google API language' => 'Google API 語言','This language will be used to display the Google Places API address suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language.' => '此語言將用於顯示 Google Places API 位址建議，位址也將以這種語言自動補全。','Result types' => '結果類型','Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better matching results. <a href="%s" target="_blank">See documentation for more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => '留空則接受任何類型的結果，通常這樣可以獲得更準確的匹配結果。<a href="%s" target="_blank">更多詳情請參閱文件</a>。<br>在位址自動完成欄位中，最多可以選擇 5 種類型的位址搜尋結果返回。<br>造訪 Google Maps 文檔，以了解有關 <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">支援類型的</a>更多資訊。','Result types (Legacy API)' => '結果類型（舊版 API）','Which type of address search results to return when using Places API (Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => '使用 Places API（舊版）時，要傳回哪種類型的位址搜尋結果？<br>造訪舊版 Google Places API 的文檔，以了解有關<a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">支援類型的</a>更多資訊。','Company fields' => '公司領域','Enable autocomplete for the company name if available' => '如果可用，請啟用公司名稱的自動完成功能。','Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name information when returned from the Google Maps APIs.' => '啟用公司欄位自動填入功能，當從 Google Maps API 傳回公司名稱資訊時，自動填入公司欄位。','Business search' => '商業搜尋','Enable search for businesses in the company field' => '啟用公司欄位中的企業搜尋功能','Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business is selected from the suggestions.' => '在公司名稱欄位中輸入公司名稱時，啟用與公司相關的地址建議；然後，從建議中選擇公司時，自動完成所有地址欄位。','Company result types' => '公司業績類型','Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => '選擇最多 5 種類型的地址搜尋結果，以便在自動完成公司欄位中傳回。<br>建議值是<code>establishment</code> ，其中包括大多數類型的企業。<br>留空則接受任何類型的結果，包括與企業無關的結果。<br>造訪 Google Maps 文檔，以了解有關 <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">支援類型的</a>更多資訊。','Google logo' => 'Google標誌','Show text and logo "Powered by Google"' => '顯示文字和徽標“由 Google 提供支援”','When checked, the text and logo "Powered by Google" will be displayed at the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box.' => '選取後，地址自動完成建議框底部將顯示「Powered by Google」字樣和標誌。','Brasil API address autocomplete' => '巴西 API 位址自動補全','Brasil API' => '巴西 API','Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields' => '啟用巴西 API 位址自動補全功能（CEP 欄位）','Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses.' => '使用巴西 API，透過 CEP/郵遞區號欄位檢索並自動填入地址。僅適用於巴西地址。','API version' => 'API 版本','Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use.' => '選擇要使用的巴西 API CEP 方法的版本。','Address book migration' => '地址簿遷移','WooCommerce addresses' => 'WooCommerce 地址','Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the customers\' address book.' => '將 WooCommerce 中現有的收貨地址和帳單地址複製到客戶的地址簿中。','Enable the address book feature' => '啟用地址簿功能','Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address to be used for shipping and billing.' => '允許客戶保存多個地址，並定義用於發貨和帳單的預設地址。','Address labels' => '地址標籤','Allow customers to add a custom label for each address' => '允許客戶為每個地址添加自訂標籤','Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their saved addresses (ie.: "Mom\'s House"). The address labels are private to the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details page or invoices.' => '地址標籤方便客戶區分已儲存的地址（例如：「媽媽家」）。地址標籤僅供客戶查看，不會顯示在訂單詳情頁面或發票上。','Display layout' => '顯示佈局','Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart.' => '選擇在結帳和購物車中如何顯示已儲存的地址。','Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page always use the cards layout.' => '結帳和購物車頁面均適用。帳戶頁面保存的地址始終使用卡片式佈局。','Address cards' => '地址卡','Address list' => '地址列表','Dropdown field' => '下拉式選單字段','Address search' => '地址搜尋','Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this number of saved addresses available.' => '當客戶保存的地址數量達到一定數量時，在前端顯示地址搜尋篩選器。','Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field.' => '當顯示佈局設定為下拉欄位時，不使用此方法。','Addresses' => '地址','Enable cart page optimizations to see more options' => '啟用購物車頁面優化以查看更多選項','Sticky order summary' => '黏性訂單摘要','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => '選擇購物車頁面上優惠券代碼部分的顯示位置。僅當啟用 AJAX 購物車且在 WooCommerce 設定中啟用優惠券代碼功能時才適用。','Layout of cross-sell' => '交叉銷售佈局','Cross-sells displayed' => '交叉銷售訊息','Items' => '專案','Cart page optimization' => '購物車頁面優化','Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout.' => '購物車頁面應採用與結帳頁面相同的清晰、以轉換率為導向的佈局。','Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase journey.' => '為了確保購物流程的一致性，購物車佈局應與結帳頁面保持一致。','Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when quantities change.' => '購物車資料在後台始終保持更新，數量變化時無需重新加載整個頁面。','Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert best.' => '將優惠券代碼、運費和交叉銷售資訊準確地放置在轉換率最高的位置。','Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where shoppers need reassurance.' => '在捲動頁面時保持訂單摘要可見，並在購物者需要放心的地方添加信任符號。','Columns' => '列','General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. Applies to other checkout, cart, thank you (order received), and view order pages.' => '結帳步驟、訂單摘要和其他部分的通用樣式。適用於其他結帳頁面、購物車頁面、感謝頁面（訂單已收到）和查看訂單頁面。','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> layout with the <em>"Split"</em> design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles.' => '當使用<em>「單列」</em>佈局和<em>「分割」</em>設計範本時，僅當頁面側邊欄小工具區域（結帳側邊欄、購物車側邊欄或訂單接收側邊欄）處於活動狀態時，才會顯示右側欄。否則，頁面將保持單列佈局，並套用拆分樣式。','Split column background' => '分欄背景','Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave empty to use the order summary background color.' => '為拆分設計中的輔助列選擇背景顏色。留空則使用訂單摘要的背景顏色。','Page templates' => '頁面模板','Checkout template' => '結帳模板','Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Read the research about cart abandonment</a>.' => '建議減少結帳時的干擾。<a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">閱讀有關購物車遺棄的研究報告</a>。','Sticky progress bar' => '黏性進度條','Progress bar style' => '進度條樣式','Order totals' => '訂單總額','Background color' => '背景顏色','Action link' => '操作連結','Mobile order summary' => '行動端訂單摘要','Mobile initial state' => '移動初始狀態','Enable editing cart items at checkout' => '允許在結帳時編輯購物車商品','Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at the checkout page.' => '允許顧客在結帳頁面直接更改產品數量或刪除商品。','Cart item errors' => '購物車商品錯誤','Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => '只有當優惠券代碼在結帳或購物車頁面作為單獨部分顯示，並且在 WooCommerce 設定中啟用了優惠券代碼的使用時才適用。','Coupon codes position' => '優惠券代碼位置','Apply coupon button' => '應用程式優惠券按鈕','Select style of the "apply coupon" button.' => '選擇「套用優惠券」按鈕的樣式。','Address line 2' => '地址行 2','This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a separate section (after).' => '此設定同時適用於「結帳」和「本地自提」頁面。在「本地自提」頁面，它也決定了「出貨/自提」選擇器是顯示在配送方式部分內（地址之前）還是作為單獨的部分（地址之後）。','Customer accounts' => '客戶帳戶','Guest checkout' => '訪客結帳','Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so you can use different values per settings profile.' => '您可以在 WooCommerce 帳戶設定頁面中找到訪客結帳、登入和帳戶建立選項。這些選項都集中在此處進行管理，方便您根據不同的設定設定檔使用不同的值。','Allow customers to checkout without an account' => '允許顧客無需註冊帳戶即可結帳。','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>建議</strong>不要在結帳時要求客戶建立帳戶或登錄，以免降低轉換率。','When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the purchase.' => '停用此功能後，客戶必須登入或建立帳戶才能完成購買。','Login at checkout' => '結帳時登入','Enable log-in during checkout' => '結帳時啟用登入功能','Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page.' => '在結帳頁面顯示一個鏈接，方便老客戶登入。','Account creation' => '建立帳戶','Allow customers to create an account during checkout' => '允許顧客在結帳時建立帳戶','Customers can create an account before placing their order.' => '顧客可以在下單前建立帳戶。','Allow customers to create an account from the My account page' => '允許客戶從「我的帳戶」頁面建立帳戶。','Customers can register a new account from the My account page.' => '客戶可以從「我的帳戶」頁面註冊新帳戶。','Username' => '使用者名稱','Generate from customer\'s name' => '根據客戶姓名生成','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>建議</strong>這樣做，這樣客戶在結帳時就不會被要求選擇用戶名，從而避免降低轉換率。','A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address when a name cannot be used.' => '使用者名稱由客戶姓名產生；如果不能使用姓名，則由電子郵件地址產生。','Password' => '密碼','Send password setup link' => '發送密碼設定連結','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>建議</strong>這樣做，以免結帳時要求客戶設定密碼，進而降低轉換率。','Customers receive an email to create their password securely.' => '客戶會收到一封電子郵件，用於安全地建立密碼。','Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate the order with their existing account when contact details match.' => '允許已註冊客戶無需登入即可完成結帳，並在聯絡資訊相符的情況下將訂單與其現有帳戶關聯。','Existing account message' => '現有帳戶訊息','Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank you page.' => '允許顧客在下單後，從感謝頁面建立帳戶。','Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed account creation.' => '啟用訪客結帳和帳戶匹配功能後，此部分中的選項才可用。啟用以上兩項功能即可設定延遲建立帳戶。','Enable delayed account creation' => '啟用延遲建立帳戶功能','Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account matching are enabled.' => '當同時啟用訪客結帳和帳戶匹配時，啟用延遲建立帳戶功能。','Section position' => '部門位置','Before customer details section' => '在客戶詳細資料部分之前','After customer details section' => '客戶詳情部分之後','Account creation benefits' => '創建帳戶的好處','Leaving the field empty will display the default text.' => '如果將此欄位留空，則會顯示預設文字。','Inline buttons' => '內聯按鈕','Required fields' => '必填字段','Enable gift message fields at checkout' => '結帳時啟用禮品留言字段','Expanded gift message' => '擴充禮品留言','Display gift message field always expanded' => '始終展開顯示禮品留言字段','Gift message in order details' => '訂單詳情中的禮品留言','No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or theme is activated.' => '目前此部分暫無整合功能。只有當外掛程式或主題啟動後，其相關選項才會顯示在此。','Phone fields' => '電話字段','Field visibility' => '場地可見性','Field position' => '場上位置','Phone country code & validation' => '電話國家代碼和驗證','Country' => '國家','Enable country on phone fields' => '在手機欄位中啟用國家/地區','Filter countries for shipping or billing' => '篩選收貨或帳單國家/地區','Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for shipping or billing on your store.' => '將每個電話號碼欄位中的國家/地區選擇器限制為您的商店允許發貨或結算的國家/地區。','Validation' => '驗證','Enable simple validation based on country rules' => '啟用基於國家/地區規則的簡單驗證','Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including country code and length.' => '檢查電話號碼在所選國家/地區是否有效，包括國家/地區代碼和長度。','Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers.' => '更嚴格檢查號碼是否為所選國家/地區認可的有效手機號碼、固定電話號碼或其他類型。某些有效號碼可能會被拒絕。','Validation types' => '驗證類型','Placeholders' => '佔位符','No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active.' => '目前無需管理任何許可證密鑰。當已授權的 Fluid Checkout 外掛程式或附加元件啟動時，許可證金鑰將顯示在此。','Default delivery type' => '預設交付類型','Choose which delivery type will be selected by default.' => '選擇預設的配送方式。','Shipping zone fields' => '運輸區域字段','Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options.' => '選擇要在本機自提配送區域篩選欄位中顯示的欄位。留空則顯示所有可用選項。','These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, if compatible plugins require them to work properly.' => '這些欄位將作為本地自提配送方式的篩選條件。如果相容的插件需要某些欄位才能正常運作，即使未在此處選擇，這些欄位仍可能在結帳時顯示。','Order shipping address' => '訂單收貨地址','Order pay page optimization' => '訂單支付頁面優化','Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout.' => '未付款訂單應採用與結帳頁面相同的清晰、以轉換率為導向的佈局。','Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment.' => '優化待付款訂單的訂單支付頁面佈局。','Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase journey.' => '將訂單支付體驗與您的結帳流程相匹配，以實現一致的購買體驗。','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying.' => '在購物者付款前需要獲得信任保障的地方，添加信任標誌和徽章。','Thank you page optimization' => '感謝您的頁面優化','Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they buy.' => '讓顧客在購買後更清楚地看到感謝頁面和訂單詳情。','Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout.' => '優化感謝頁面和帳號訂單詳情，使其佈局更清晰。','Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make sense.' => '在適當的地方顯示訂單狀態進度、操作、下載和備註。','Customize order details sections on email notifications.' => '自訂電子郵件通知中的訂單詳情部分。','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase.' => '在購物者購買後需要獲得信任保障的地方，添加信任標誌和徽章。','Email notifications' => '電子郵件通知','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options' => '啟用感謝頁面和訂單詳情優化，即可查看更多選項','Use wide layout on thank you page' => '感謝頁面使用寬版佈局','These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account pages and on email notifications.' => '這些選項會影響感謝頁面、帳戶頁面上的訂單詳情查看以及電子郵件通知。','Save settings' => '儲存設定','Docs' => '文件','Cart' => '大車','Thank you' => '謝謝','Address autocomplete' => '地址自動補全','Trust badges' => '信任徽章','You do not have permission to save these settings.' => '您沒有權限保存這些設定。','Invalid save request.' => '無效的保存請求。','Your settings have been saved.' => '您的設定已儲存。','Saving...' => '儲存...','Settings could not be saved. Please try again.' => '設定無法儲存，請重試。','Dismiss notice' => '駁回通知','Open settings menu' => '開啟設定選單','Close settings menu' => '關閉設定選單','Preview' => '預覽','Expand preview' => '展開預覽','Collapse preview' => '折疊預覽','Show header and footer' => '顯示頁首和頁尾','Hide header and footer' => '隱藏頁首和頁尾','Page preview' => '頁面預覽','Preview viewport' => '預覽視口','Tablet' => '藥片','Desktop' => '桌面','Preview width' => '預覽寬度','Decrease width' => '減小寬度','Preview width in pixels' => '預覽寬度（像素）','Increase width' => '增加寬度','Preview as' => '預覽','Guest' => '客人','Logged in' => '已登入','Preview page' => '預覽頁面','Expand preview for a closer look' => '展開預覽查看詳情','Available with %s.' => '可用%s。','Turn them on' => '打開它們','Optimizations for this page are turned off. %s to preview the page.' => '此頁面的優化已關閉。輸入 %s 可預覽頁面。','%s preview' => '%s 預覽','Isolated session · nothing is saved' => '獨立會話 · 未儲存任何內容','Usage tracking' => '使用情況追蹤','Send non-sensitive site environment reports to help Fluid Checkout improve compatibility. Reports are not sent until enabled in the options below.' => '傳送非敏感網站環境報告，以協助 Fluid Checkout 提升相容性。報告功能需在下方選項中啟用後才會發送。','Send usage tracking reports to Fluid Checkout' => '將使用情況追蹤報告發送至 Fluid Checkout','These reports help us improve compatibility and support for your site and are sent weekly when enabled.' => '這些報告有助於我們改善您網站的相容性和支持，啟用後每週都會發送。','No customer, admin user, or any other sensitive data is included in the reports.' => '報告中不包含任何客戶、管理員使用者或任何其他敏感資料。','Basic environment info' => '基本環境資訊','WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, theme, and plugin list data. Always included when reporting is enabled. Helps us understand the environment your site is running in.' => 'WordPress、PHP、WooCommerce、主題和外掛程式清單資料。啟用報告功能後，資料始終包含在內。這有助於我們了解您網站的運作環境。','Plugin settings' => '插件設定','Sends Fluid Checkout plugin settings to help with support requests and helps us understand how you are using our plugins.' => '發送 Fluid Checkout 插件設置，以幫助我們處理支援請求，並幫助我們了解您如何使用我們的插件。','Coming soon' => '即將推出','Sales metrics' => '銷售指標','Monthly order count and total sales for one year prior to installing Fluid Checkout up to today. Helps us understand if you are making more money with our plugins installed. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => '我們會統計您安裝 Fluid Checkout 外掛程式前後一年內的月訂單量和總銷售額，以幫助您了解安裝我們的外掛程式是否提升了您的收益。我們絕不會發送任何客戶或用戶資料。','Utilities' => '公用事業','Use <code>TomSelect</code> dropdown components instead of <code>select2</code>' => '使用<code>TomSelect</code>下拉組件代替<code>select2</code>','TomSelect is a simpler dropdown selection component which is less prone to errors than Select2, while offering the same functionality.' => 'TomSelect 是更簡單的下拉選擇組件，與 Select2 相比，它出錯的機率更低，同時提供了相同的功能。','Sets the font size inside form fields to 16px on pages optimized by this plugin to avoid automatically zooming in when interacting with form fields on small devices.' => '在經過此外掛程式優化的頁面上，將表單欄位內的字體大小設為 16px，以避免在小型裝置上與表單欄位互動時自動放大。','Safari and other browsers might automatically zoom in on mobile devices to make the text easier to read when the font size is smaller than 16px.' => '當字體大小小於 16px 時，Safari 和其他瀏覽器可能會在行動裝置上自動放大文本，使文字更易於閱讀。','Enable script processing tracking on the browser console.' => '在瀏覽器控制台中啟用腳本處理追蹤。','Unminified assets' => '未計入資產','Google Maps scripts' => 'Google 地圖腳本','Do not remove duplicate Google Maps scripts' => '請勿刪除重複的Google地圖腳本。','When enabled, duplicate Google Maps scripts will NOT be removed which can cause errors and performance issues. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => '啟用此選項後，重複的 Google Maps 腳本將不會被刪除，這可能會導致錯誤和效能問題。請僅在排查故障時使用此選項。','Widget areas' => '小部件區域','Last step on mobile' => '手機上的最後一步','Display widgets only at last step on mobile' => '在行動裝置上，僅在最後一步顯示小部件','Display checkout trust badge widgets only when viewing the last checkout step on mobile devices' => '僅在行動裝置上查看結帳的最後一個步驟時顯示結帳信任徽章小部件','Standard' => '標準','VAT number field' => '增值稅號字段','Add a VAT number field to the billing form.' => '在帳單表格中新增增值稅號欄位。','Field label' => '字段標籤','Set the label of the VAT number field (ie. VAT number). On multi-language websites, it is better to leave this field empty and translate the original string.' => '設定增值稅號欄位的標籤（例如：增值稅號）。在多語言網站上，最好將此欄位留空並翻譯原始字串。','VAT Number' => '增值稅號','EU-VAT' => '歐盟增值稅','Enable the VAT number field to see more options' => '啟用增值稅號欄位以查看更多選項','VAT validation' => '增值稅驗證','Validate VAT number field for EU-VAT during checkout' => '結帳時驗證歐盟增值稅號欄位。','Checks if the VAT Number provided is a valid VAT number registered on the European VIES Database (VAT Information Exchange System).' => '檢查所提供的增值稅號碼是否為已在歐洲增值稅資訊交換系統 (VIES) 資料庫中註冊的有效增值稅號碼。','Shop VAT number' => '商店增值稅號','The shop\'s VAT number used for requesting EU-VAT validation, and printed on invoices. <br><strong>We strongly recommend adding your Shop VAT number</strong> as otherwise the VIES consultation results might not be valid for accounting purposes. <br>Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> or <code>EE999999999</code>.' => '商店的增值稅號碼用於申請歐盟增值稅驗證，並印在發票上。<br><strong>我們強烈建議您新增您的店鋪增值稅號</strong>，否則 VIES 諮詢結果可能不適用於會計。<br>即： <code>ATU99999999</code>或<code>EE999999999</code> 。','Reverse charge' => '反向充電','Apply reverse charge mechanism' => '應用反向充電機制','Set tax rate to zero and display "Reverse charge" on invoices when the customer\'s VAT number is valid. A different "Reverse charge" text might be required depending on the store\'s country.' => '當客戶的增值稅號有效時，將稅率設為零，並在發票上顯示「反向徵收」。根據商店所在國家/地區的不同，可能需要使用不同的“反向徵收”文本。','Same country' => '同一個國家','Apply reverse charge mechanism for transactions in the shop country:' => '對商店所在國家的交易採用反向收費機制：','Enables applying reverse charge mechanism for transactions between companies in the same country as the shop.' => '允許對與店舖位於同一國家/地區的公司之間的交易應用反向收費機制。','Reverse charge exceptions' => '反向收費例外情況','Select additional countries to skip applying the reverse charge mechanism.' => '選擇其他國家以跳過反向徵稅機制。','Taxes will be charged to orders from these countries even when a valid VAT number is provided.' => '即使提供了有效的增值稅號，來自這些國家的訂單仍需繳稅。','Reverse charge label on invoices' => '發票上的反向收費標籤','Set the label of "reverse charge" on the checkout page and order details.' => '在結帳頁面和訂單詳情中設定「反向收費」標籤。','Reverse charge text on invoices' => '發票上的反向收費文本','Set the label of "reverse charge" text on invoices.' => '在發票上設定「反向收費」標籤文字。','Tax to be paid on reverse charge basis' => '按反向徵收機制繳稅','Company name' => '公司名稱','Autocomplete company name from VAT number' => '根據增值稅號自動補全公司名稱','Fill in the billing company name based on the valid VAT number provided by the customer.' => '根據客戶提供的有效增值稅號填寫帳單公司名稱。','Company name editing' => '公司名稱編輯','Allow editing of auto-filled company name' => '允許編輯自動填入的公司名稱','When enabled, customers can change the company name associated with the provided VAT number.' => '啟用此功能後，客戶可以變更與提供的增值稅號關聯的公司名稱。','EU-VAT for digital goods' => '歐盟數位商品增值稅','From January 1st, 2015, modifications have been made to the EU VAT regulations concerning digital goods, impacting exclusively B2C transactions. The VAT on digital goods must be calculated based on the customer\'s location, and evidence of this needs to be collected (IP address and billing address).' => '自2015年1月1日起，歐盟增值稅法規對數位商品進行了修訂，該修訂僅影響B2C交易。數位商品的增值稅必須根據客戶的所在地計算，並且需要收集相關證明（IP地址和帳單地址）。','Tax classes for digital goods' => '數位商品的稅收類別','Select some tax classes' => '選擇一些稅類','Location evidence' => '位置證據','Collect customer\'s location evidence' => '收集客戶位置證據','Saves the IP address and validate it against the customer\'s billing address. Customer\'s must confirm their billing address by checking a checkbox on the checkout page if the country from their billing address and IP do not match.' => '儲存 IP 位址並將其與客戶的帳單位址進行驗證。如果客戶的帳單位址和 IP 位址所在的國家/地區不匹配，則客戶必須在結帳頁面上勾選複選框以確認其帳單位址。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Change it in Customer accounts settings</a>.' => '此選項在 Fluid Checkout 中進行管理。<a href="%s">請在客戶帳戶設定中更改它</a>。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. Change it under Fluid Checkout > Customer accounts.' => '此選項在 Fluid Checkout 中進行管理。請在 Fluid Checkout &gt; 客戶帳戶中變更。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout settings</a>.' => '此選項在 Fluid Checkout 中進行管理。啟用 Fluid Checkout 後，收貨地址始終設定為「預設客戶收貨地址」。客戶在結帳時仍可提供不同的收貨地址和帳單地址。<br><br> <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout 設定</a>中提供了一個選項，可以將預設帳單地址設定為與收貨地址相同。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce > Settings > Fluid Checkout.' => '此選項在 Fluid Checkout 中進行管理。啟用 Fluid Checkout 後，收貨地址始終設定為「預設客戶收貨地址」。客戶仍然可以在結帳時提供不同的收貨地址和帳單地址。<br><br>在 WooCommerce &gt; 設定 &gt; Fluid Checkout 中，可以選擇將預設帳單地址設定為與收貨地址相同。','These settings have been moved to WP Admin > Fluid Checkout > Settings.' => '這些設定已移至 WP 管理背景 &gt; Fluid Checkout &gt; 設定。','This WooCommerce Settings tab is deprecated and will be removed in Fluid Checkout 6.0.' => '此 WooCommerce 設定標籤已棄用，將在 Fluid Checkout 6.0 中移除。','Go to settings page' => '前往設定頁面','Hide this tab permanently' => '永久隱藏此標籤頁','Site report preview' => '網站報告預覽','This is the data that would be included in the next site environment report based on your current settings.' => '根據您目前的設置，以下數據將包含在下一份站點環境報告中。','Loading report preview...' => '正在載入報告預覽...','Could not load the site report preview. Try again.' => '網站報告預覽無法加載，請重試。','Could not send the site report. Try again.' => '無法傳送網站報告，請重試。','Site report sent successfully.' => '現場報告已成功發送。','Enable and send now' => '立即啟用並發送','Close' => '關閉','A site report request is already in progress. Try again in a moment.' => '網站報告請求正在處理中，請稍後再試。','Site environment reporting is disabled.' => '站點環境報告功能已停用。','No site report data is available to send.' => '沒有可供發送的站點報告資料。','This site domain cannot send environment reports (local or development domains are excluded).' => '此網站網域無法傳送環境報告（本機或開發網域除外）。','A site report was sent recently. Try again later.' => '近期已發送一份站點報告。請稍後再試。','The site report could not be sent. Try again later.' => '網站報告發送失敗，請稍後再試。','Site environment reporting is not available.' => '無法提供站點環境報告。','No site report data is available for the selected settings.' => '所選設定下沒有可用的站點報告資料。','You are not allowed to manage site reports.' => '您無權管理站點報告。','PRO feature' => '專業功能','Other plugins' => '其他插件','Get only this add-on &mdash; %s' => '僅取得此附加元件 — %s','Install add-on' => '安裝插件','Upgrade to PRO &mdash; %s' => '升級到專業版 — %s','<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Get %2$s</a> to unlock these options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">取得 %2$s</a>以解鎖這些選項。','Add-on' => '添加在','View documentation' => '查看文件','Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the current user\'s data, or pass user_id to target another account when the caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found.' => '請求需要已登入的 WordPress 使用者。省略 user_id 參數可使用目前使用者的數據，或當呼叫者擁有編輯使用者權限（edit_user 功能）時，傳遞 user_id 參數可指向其他帳號。未經身份驗證的請求將傳回 fc_api_forbidden 錯誤。無效的 user_id 將傳回 fc_api_user_not_found 錯誤。','HTTP 200 with { "data": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload.' => '當處理程序傳回有效負載時，HTTP 200 狀態碼為 { &quot;data&quot;: { ... } }。','HTTP 200 with { "success": true } when there is no payload (for example DELETE).' => '當沒有有效負載時（例如 DELETE），HTTP 200 傳回 { &quot;success&quot;: true }。','Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix.' => '失敗時，WordPress REST 請求會從 WP_Error 物件傳回錯誤 JSON 資料（包含 code、message 和 data.status）。請求代碼使用 fc_api_* 前綴。','Forbidden access.' => '禁止訪問。','Target user was not found.' => '未找到目標用戶。','This feature is not available.' => '此功能不可用。','A required address field is missing.' => '地址欄位必填項缺失。','Postcode or ZIP is invalid.' => '郵遞區號無效。','Phone number is invalid.' => '電話號碼無效。','State or county is invalid.' => '州或縣無效。','Country is invalid or has no address fields.' => '國家/地區資訊無效或缺少地址欄位。','The request could not be processed.' => '請求無法處理。','Back to previous step' => '返回上一步','Skip to settings' => '跳至設定','Start over and return to the first guided setup step' => '重新開始，回到第一個引導設定步驟。','Start over' => '重新開始','Please complete all sub-steps before continuing.' => '請先完成所有子步驟再繼續。','Expand' => '擴張','Collapse' => '坍塌','Skip' => '跳過','Mark as complete' => '標記為已完成','Mark as incomplete' => '標記為未完成','View full-size image: %s' => '查看完整尺寸圖像：%s','Full-size setup guide image' => '全尺寸安裝指南圖片','Close image' => '關閉影像','Fluid Checkout Guided Setup' => 'Fluid Checkout 引導式設置','Welcome' => '歡迎','Explore your checkout' => '探索您的結帳流程','All set' => '一切就緒','You do not have permission to access this page.' => '您沒有權限存取此頁面。','Go to step %1$d: %2$s' => '轉到步驟 %1$d: %2$s','This guided setup helps you get familiar with Fluid Checkout. The steps below are placeholders for now.' => '本引導式設定可協助您熟悉 Fluid Checkout。以下步驟目前僅為佔位符。','Continue to the next step when you are ready.' => '準備就緒後，請繼續下一步。','Open your store checkout to see Fluid Checkout in action.' => '開啟您的商店結帳頁面，即可查看 Fluid Checkout 的實際應用程式。','View checkout page' => '查看結帳頁面','You can return to Fluid Checkout settings to continue configuring your store.' => '您可以返回 Fluid Checkout 設定繼續配置您的商店。','Review checkout and cart settings' => '查看結帳和購物車設置','Explore add-ons from the dashboard' => '從控制台瀏覽插件。','Finish & go to settings' => '完成並進入設置','Update the billing phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => '將帳單電話欄位可見性選項從舊值更新為符合 WooCommerce 規範。','Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => '將收貨電話欄位可見性選項從舊值更新為符合 WooCommerce 規範。','Copy the order summary background color setting to the new Split design secondary column background color option.' => '將訂單摘要背景顏色設定複製到新的分割設計輔助列背景顏色選項。','The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the Biteship plugin.' => '使用 Bitship 外掛程式時，增強型選擇欄位功能始終處於停用狀態。','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => '使用 German Market 外掛程式時，「下單」按鈕的位置始終設定為「訂單摘要下方」。該插件要求“下單”按鈕和法律複選框顯示在訂單摘要下方。','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => '使用 Germanized for WooCommerce 時，「下單」按鈕的位置始終設定為「訂單摘要下方」。該插件要求“下單”按鈕和法律複選框顯示在訂單摘要下方。','Edit pickup locations' => '編輯取貨地點','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => '使用 WooCommerce 設定中的本地取貨標籤','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => '啟用後，結帳頁面上的取貨選項標籤將與 WooCommerce 取貨地點設定中的標題一致。停用後，標籤將使用 Fluid Checkout 中可翻譯的「本地取貨」文字。','Button label for applying coupon codesApply' => '申請','Checkout step titleContact' => '接觸','Checkout step titleShipping' => '船運','Checkout step titleBilling' => '計費','Checkout step titlePayment' => '支付','Checkout substep change link labelChange' => '改變','Checkout substep save link labelSave changes' => '儲存變更','Substep review textNone.' => '沒有任何。','Substep review field format%1$s' => '%1$s','Substep review field format: with label%2$s: %1$s' => '%2$s: %1$s','Image uploader.No image selected.' => '未選擇圖片。','Settings sectionCart' => '大車','Settings sectionOrder pay' => '訂單支付','Settings sectionThank you' => '謝謝','Settings section titleIntegrations' => '整合','Settings section titleLicense keys' => '許可證密鑰','Captcha positionBefore place order section' => '下訂單部分前','Captcha positionBefore place order button' => '下訂單按鈕前','No shipping method chosen label for the order summary--' => '--','Close button aria-labelClose' => '關閉','Log in link label at checkout contact stepLog in' => '登入','Log in separator label at for when guest checkout is disabledOr continue below' => '或繼續下面','Log in separator label at for when guest checkout is disabledOr continue as a guest' => '或以訪客身分繼續','Clear image selection on admin pages.Remove image' => '刪除圖片','shipping packagesShipping %d' => '運費百分比','shipping packagesShipping' => '船運','Used as fallback for "Proceed to next step" button labelnext step' => '下一步','Substep review checkbox valueYes' => '是的','Substep review checkbox line%1$s: %2$s' => '%1$s: %2$s','Dummy customer first name in the admin previewJohn' => '約翰','Dummy customer last name in the admin previewDoe' => '牝鹿','Dummy customer company in the admin previewExample Company' => '範例公司','Dummy customer street address in the admin preview123 Main Street' => '主街123號','Dummy customer city in the admin previewAnytown' => '安尼鎮','Dummy order notes in the admin previewPlease leave the package at the front door.' => '請將包裹放在前門。','Dummy product name in the admin previewBeanie' => '毛線帽','Dummy product name in the admin previewCap' => '帽子','Dummy product name in the admin previewT-Shirt' => 'T恤','Dummy order update in the admin previewWe received your order and will send you an update when it ships.' => '我們已收到您的訂單，出貨後會發送更新通知給您。','Dummy download in the admin previewUser guide' => '使用者指南','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (New)' => '地點 API（新增）','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (Legacy)' => 'Places API（舊版）','Brasil API versionsVersion 1' => '版本 1','Brasil API versionsVersion 2' => '版本 2','Delayed account creation benefits placeholder text✔ C